                    rev_subscription:       `Recurring subscription — a managed digital-presence service, billed monthly, compounding`,
                    rev_platform:           `Platform take-rate — a self-serve tool, margin on each interaction (a different operating logic)`,
                    rev_project:            `One-off project fees — keep today's transactional model, just for digital work`,
                    rev_freemium:           `Freemium-to-paid — a free tier funnel converting slowly to paid plans`,
