                    insight_funded:         `Strong reserves remaining: you reinvented the model and still kept a real cash cushion. That combination — coherence, confidence and runway intact — is what turns a rescue into a durable new business.`,

                    hint_insolvent:         `The runway has run out — the model is solvent-on-paper but out of cash. Recurring revenue pays slowly; investment and stranded plant cost must be modelled against the 14-month clock, not just the headline plan.`,
